/target
**/*.rs.bk
Cargo.lock.orig

# Closed-overlay safety: NDA / customer / export-controlled material must NEVER be
# committed. Keep such inputs out of the tree entirely; these patterns are a
# backstop, not a licence to place secrets in the repo.
/data/
/private/
*.nda
*.confidential
*-customer-*
*-device-data*
